OL,3,GNEWSAEleven more arrests over Bonfire
OL,4,ANight disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven more people have been arrested
OL,7,Fover the weekend after disorder on
OL,8,FBonfire Night.
OL,10,FFireworks and bricks were launched at
OL,11,Femergency services in Meadow Well,
OL,12,FNorth Tyneside, on Thursday, with the
OL,13,Fdisorder linked to misinformation that
OL,14,Fa building would be used to house
OL,15,Fasylum seekers, Northumbria Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FA number of officers were injured, and
OL,19,Ffive police cars and three fire engines
OL,20,Fwere damaged.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
