OL,3,GNEWSAEleven more arrests over Bonfire
OL,4,ANight disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said all 11 arrests were on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of violent disorder, bringing
OL,8,Fthe total to 17, with those arrested
OL,9,Faged from 12 to 66. Ch Supt Daniel
OL,10,FWhyte said further arrests were
OL,11,Fexpected in the coming days.
